	measure 'PL BL Color' = ```
			SWITCH(TRUE(),  
			 MAX('P&L Builder'[Color]) =1, "#EDEDED"
			 ,MAX('P&L Builder'[Color]) =2, "#CAD5d5"
			)
			```
		lineageTag: e8fc197e-ddc0-4233-bf88-5d6179d6164c

